  "item.ae2enhanced.stable_spacetime_manifold.tooltip": "§e§lStable Spacetime Manifold §7\nA self-stabilizing region of spacetime extracted from the event horizon,\nmaintaining topological integrity under extreme curvature.\n§8A piece of stable spacetime manifold\n§b§l\"Where time stands still\"",
  "item.ae2enhanced.differential_form_stabilizer.tooltip": "§e§lDifferential Form Stabilizer §7\nStabilizes the differential geometric structure of spacetime,\npreventing catastrophic manifold degeneration.\n§8Sufficient to stabilize the metric variations caused by the black hole\n§b§l\"Form without boundary, stable without limit\"",
  "item.ae2enhanced.conformal_invariant_charge.tooltip": "§e§lConformal Invariant Charge §7\nA topological quantum charge preserved under conformal transformations,\ninvariant across all reference frames.\n§8A creation from the black hole, an incomprehensible form of matter\n§b§l\"Invariance is the only true constant\"",
  "item.ae2enhanced.micro_singularity": "Constrained Micro Singularity",
  "item.ae2enhanced.micro_singularity.tooltip.permanent": "§bPermanent",
  "item.ae2enhanced.micro_singularity.tooltip.remaining": "§7Remaining lifetime: §e%s §7s",
  "item.ae2enhanced.micro_singularity.tooltip.hint": "§8§o\"A creation from the event horizon\"\n§7The countdown runs at §e1/30 §7speed while in item form.\n§7Throw it and let it rest on the ground to restore the block form,\n§7which returns the empty Singularity Constrictor.\n§7Generation: §eThrow 64 AE2 Singularities and 4 Nether Stars §7onto the ground,\n§7then §ehold 1 Nether Star and right-click an ME Controller §7to spawn a Micro Singularity.",
  "item.ae2enhanced.singularity_constrictor": "Singularity Constrictor",
  "item.ae2enhanced.singularity_constrictor.tooltip": "§e§lSingularity Constrictor §7\nRight-click a Micro Singularity to constrain it into item form.\nThrow the singularity onto the ground to restore it,\nreturning the empty constrictor on the spot.\n§8Binding the infinite abyss in an invariant shell\n§b§l\"An event horizon in the palm of your hand\"",
